"false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Geographic Features", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about geographical features, you talk about natural things like bodies of water, plants, animals, and how the land looks.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Geographic features in Petra include things like:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "rose-colored sandstone </br>stone </br>rock walls </br>winding canyon </br>valley ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It'<span class=\"strong\">s</span> in a long, winding sandstone canyon along the east side of a valley. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You <span class=\"strong\">ride</span> or walk in between the rock walls.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you talk about geographical features, you use the<span class=\"strong\"> Present Simple</span> tense. <br>You use the <span class=\"strong\"> Present Simple</span> tense because you are talking about something in general or giving facts.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rose", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a light red-purple color", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to paint my walls a rose color.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about Petra.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to carve", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something by cutting into it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He carved a statue from that large stone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "winding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to twist or turn something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The vines were winding around the trees.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sandstone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a soft yellow or red rock often used as a building material", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Use sandstone to cut out blocks for the building.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "valley", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area of low land between hills or mountains", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We went for a nice walk in the valley.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to rent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to pay to live somewhere", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I pay a lot of rent to live in this house.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "amphitheater", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a steep, sloped circular open air theater", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I went to the amphitheater to watch the play.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "monastery", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the place where some religious men live", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will tour the monastery and pray with the monks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "treasury", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a building where money is kept", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to visit the old treasury buildings.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Make notes on the geographic features in your area. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Point out things like bodies of water, plants, animals, and how the land looks.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 6-8 sentences to describe the area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your description to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I make notes on the geographical features in my area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 50 - 75 words about the geographical features of my area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}